FFmpeg master 72844226eb8c (2026-11-10), not in 9.1:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/72844226eb8c7fc76bc71ce81f8343d09332f1a1

The AAC encoder: a frame over the decoder buffer was encoded again at a lower
lambda until it fitted, with no bound: a frame the coder could not fit at any
lambda hung ffmpeg (FFmpeg issue 25580; a conversion that never ends). Now at
most 16 tries, from the nominal lambda, then a lowpass in steps until it fits;
every try starts from the pristine coefficients.

